From: Jose Drowne <jdrowne@10ulabs.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Dec 2025 22:26:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Address PR #6815 review feedback: improve CFunc
 inlining
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Changes based on reviewer feedback:
- Rename V3InlineCfuncs → V3InlineCFuncs (capitalize "CFuncs")
- Use exists() instead of foreach() for early termination checks
- Process per AstNodeModule for better cache behavior
- Implement variable merging (clone local vars with unique names)
- Add two tunables: --inline-cfuncs (size) and --inline-cfuncs-product (size×calls)
- Revert V3FuncOpt.cpp threading/atomic changes
- Fix VarRef remapping to iterate all sibling statements

Test updates:
- t_opt_inline_cfuncs.v: Simplified test to avoid combinational loops
- t_opt_inline_cfuncs_off.py: Use file_grep_not for disabled check
- t_timing_debug1.py: Disable inlining to preserve golden file
- t_verilated_debug.py: Disable inlining to preserve golden file

